    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Agente LangChain (dentro del microservicio FastAPI)\n\nNo es un nodo de n8n: el nodo 4 llama a `POST /api/v1/triage/{alert_id}` y allí corre `app/services/triage.py`:\n\n1. Tools: VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, GeoIP, inteligencia local (enriquecimiento persistido en `enrichment_data`).\n2. Agente `create_agent` (LangChain 1.x) con `response_format=TriageDecision`.\n3. LLM local Ollama (llama3.1/mistral) -> sin exfiltracion de alertas.\n4. Fallback heuristico si Ollama no responde.\n5. Devuelve: verdict, severity, confidence, summary, recommended_actions.\n\nSalida del nodo 4: JSON de triaje usado por el nodo 6.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "node-05-nota-agente",
      "name": "Nota 5 - Agente LangChain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "rule-alta",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.predicted_severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "alta",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "alta",
              "fallbackOutput": "extra"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "rule-media",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.predicted_severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "media",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "media",
              "fallbackOutput": "extra"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "baja"
        }
      },
